                "to come to the ear, become known; {#tadguREH karRamAgatya#}\n <ls>R. 1. 9</ls>; {@{#karRe kf#}@} to put round the ear; <ls>Ch. P. 10</ls>; {#karRe kaTayati#}\n whispers in the ear; <ab>cf.</ab> {#zawkarRa, catuzkarRa#} <ab>&c.</ab> also.\n",
